"Each hero student gets a powered gray unitard gym suit, sealed by running a hand up its front."
"Gym suits still hurt when hit; faculty can turn their protection up or down."
"Gym suits do not prevent muscle fatigue or soreness."
"Students may not store them in dorms or experiment on them; a cleaner cabinet washes them."
"They stiffen to shield blows, show a scrolling damage list and dampen loud sounds."
"They are valuable magical equipment, and nobody may touch another person's suit."
"They simulate injuries by stiffening to restrict movement, such as ten percent for a hit."
